    {
      "type": "split",
      "heading": "What we do",
      "body": "Every business is now in the business of data. In an era where digital transformation drives success, companies are amassing vast amounts of data—but only those that **effectively harness it** will gain a competitive edge. **Trusted by agile, data-driven organizations**, we are committed to delivering **transparency, scalability, and efficiency** in every step of your data journey.",
